  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "軌道工程之興建與維護技術",
    "sub_ename": "CONSTRUCTION AND MAINTENANCE OF RAILWAY ENGINEERING",
    "describe_ch": "高速鐵路自1964年已陸續啟用，其提供高速度、高運量、低污染及高能源效率的現代運輸工具。許多國家正都在發展、建設它們的HSR。我國HSR自1999年興建2007年營運，再於2012年增建三站及延伸至南港2016年營運，至今共已擁有18年的HSR設計、興建、增建、延伸技術及營運維護經驗。國際高鐵協會已肯定我HSR興建與維護技術績效卓越。透過本課程之學習，期望學員除了能獲得HSR技術之傳承及問題處理能力外，對於其他傳統鐵道、捷運及輕軌等系統也能舉一反三得心應手。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "HSR has been in service since 1964.It’s provides a high speed, high capacity, low pollution and high energy efficiency modern transportation tool. Many countries are developing their HSR system and new technologies, as well as building their HSR. Taiwan had built HSR, started from 1999 and operated in 2007.Then they built 3 more stations and extend it to Nan kang station, started from 2012 and operated in 2016. So up to date, we have gained 18 years’ experience in HSR of design, construction, operation and maintenance as well as extension works. \r\nAn outstanding award to THSR was issued from International High Speed Rail Association. We expect that the student will learn the design principles and construction techniques of HSR system as well as other system.\r\n",
