    "tpb_seq": 1,
    "tpb_book": "<div>鐵道工程之興建與維護技術-Railway Engineering Works for Construction and Maintenance (2020/9/1)</div>\n\n<div>台灣高鐵車站 (2018/7)</div>\n\n<div>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; width:100.0%\">\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #bbbbbb; border-left:1px solid #bbbbbb; border-right:1px solid #bbbbbb; border-top:1px solid #bbbbbb; vertical-align:bottom\">\n\t\t\t<div><strong>書名/文獻/工具</strong></div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #bbbbbb; border-left:1px solid #bbbbbb; border-right:1px solid #bbbbbb; border-top:none; vertical-align:top\">\n\t\t\t<div>軌道工程施工概述(2016/12)</div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;鐵路機電系統工程概述 (2008/8)</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;全跨預鑄吊裝工法概述 (2004/5)</div>\n",
